1316	 * \param card pointer to the sc_card structure
1317	 * \param file pointer to a sc_file object
1318	 * \return SC_SUCCESS or error code
1319	 *
1320	 * This function finishes the creation of a DF (or MF) and activates
1321	 * the ACs.
